{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Catharage",
    "steam_appid": 3879850,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a navigator, a protector of Catharage station. Countless enemies threaten its survival. You must venture out into the unknown, gather strength, and vanquish our foes before they can destroy us. <i>The city stands eternal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/87bc50309b56b62cb1308145c4ae3a1a.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space tactics roguelite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Catharage, you pilot a single spaceship through space. Your ship is equipped with weapons and modules that you can use to engage enemies (or evade them). You'll find loot that you can equip or scrap for currency. You will complete missions for Catharage station, earning valuable credits. Should you die, all is lost - but return home in time, and your reward is saved. Use what you recover to upgrade and unlock ships, hire fleet members or pay for one-time bonuses, to face tougher enemies and go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/8b17ec665031c1de8137545ec6a2b6a5.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your fleet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a dozen different ships to fly, each with their own attributes. Some may be large and slow, but highly armored. Others are nimble and frail, yet hit beyond their size. Discover three weapon types with several special perks that change their behaviour. Find modules that grant attributes or active abilities, such as microwarp drives, cloaking devices, or EMP blasts. Items may come with special traits, such as scaling damage or set bonuses. Loot rolls in rarities ranging from scrap-worthy to run-changing, and every kill may change your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/e26216e905bb3affa7864f312db23fbe.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New run, new build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you become stronger over time through investment in global attribute bonuses, variance exists on a smaller scale as well. Each run, you can find special upgrades that may change its course: Pick up an engineering upgrade before you start and make your weak corvette into a strong brawler. Find a forge to turn a lumbering battleship into a nimble kiter. Every encounter is different. Maybe you'll chance upon a battle in progress and scavenge the remains - or jump straight into a gas cloud that strips your armor, leaving you vulnerable to enemies you once thought beneath you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/26614fa32bd5d54c4eeae45d7e701cfb.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serenity and Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catharage is a slow-paced but punctuated game. Since you decide where to fly and who to fight, sessions can be as calm or hectic as your taste demands. While space is large and atmospheric, fights can quickly become overwhelming - make sure you're adequately prepared. The game is challenging, but knowledge reigns supreme: Learning about enemies, systems and strategy is key to mastering the encounters and obstacles set before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/239e3f99d75bfddb7bf532a16b232b44.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Catharage is a part-time solo development project. A demo is coming soon.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a navigator, a protector of Catharage station. Countless enemies threaten its survival. You must venture out into the unknown, gather strength, and vanquish our foes before they can destroy us. <i>The city stands eternal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/87bc50309b56b62cb1308145c4ae3a1a.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space tactics roguelite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Catharage, you pilot a single spaceship through space. Your ship is equipped with weapons and modules that you can use to engage enemies (or evade them). You'll find loot that you can equip or scrap for currency. You will complete missions for Catharage station, earning valuable credits. Should you die, all is lost - but return home in time, and your reward is saved. Use what you recover to upgrade and unlock ships, hire fleet members or pay for one-time bonuses, to face tougher enemies and go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/8b17ec665031c1de8137545ec6a2b6a5.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your fleet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a dozen different ships to fly, each with their own attributes. Some may be large and slow, but highly armored. Others are nimble and frail, yet hit beyond their size. Discover three weapon types with several special perks that change their behaviour. Find modules that grant attributes or active abilities, such as microwarp drives, cloaking devices, or EMP blasts. Items may come with special traits, such as scaling damage or set bonuses. Loot rolls in rarities ranging from scrap-worthy to run-changing, and every kill may change your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/e26216e905bb3affa7864f312db23fbe.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New run, new build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you become stronger over time through investment in global attribute bonuses, variance exists on a smaller scale as well. Each run, you can find special upgrades that may change its course: Pick up an engineering upgrade before you start and make your weak corvette into a strong brawler. Find a forge to turn a lumbering battleship into a nimble kiter. Every encounter is different. Maybe you'll chance upon a battle in progress and scavenge the remains - or jump straight into a gas cloud that strips your armor, leaving you vulnerable to enemies you once thought beneath you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/26614fa32bd5d54c4eeae45d7e701cfb.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serenity and Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catharage is a slow-paced but punctuated game. Since you decide where to fly and who to fight, sessions can be as calm or hectic as your taste demands. While space is large and atmospheric, fights can quickly become overwhelming - make sure you're adequately prepared. The game is challenging, but knowledge reigns supreme: Learning about enemies, systems and strategy is key to mastering the encounters and obstacles set before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879850/extras/239e3f99d75bfddb7bf532a16b232b44.avif?t=1753739550\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Catharage is a part-time solo development project. A demo is coming soon.</i></p>",
